From f569df1593bef28ed11787d93132ea17fe1ba6ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cecylia Bocovich <cohosh@torproject.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:49:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Use dependencies compatible with go1.22

To generate this patch, I did the following:
git checkout main
patch -p1 < go-1.22.patch
cp go.mod gomod.old
cp go.sum gosum.old
git checkout [working branch]
mv gomod.old go.mod
mv gosum.old go.sum

It just preserves the go.mod state after applying the previous
go-1.22.patch without attempting to update any dependencies.
